ificity similar to that of pepsin A,but also cleaves 7-Cys(SO3H)-|-Gly-8 and 17-Leu-|-Val-18 in the B chainof insulin"],"label":"scytalidopepsin A","obo_id":"EC:3.4.23.31","type":"class"},{"iri":"https://www.enzyme-database.org/query.php?ec\u003d3.4.24.12","ontology_name":"ec","related_synonyms":["hatching enzyme","sea-urchin-hatching proteinase"],"ontology_prefix":"EC","short_form":"EC_3.4.24.12","description":["Hydrolysis of proteins of the fertilization envelope and dimethylcasein"],"label":"envelysin","obo_id":"EC:3.4.24.12","type":"class"},{"iri":"https://www.enzyme-database.org/query.php?ec\u003d3.4.21.53","ontology_name":"ec","related_synonyms":["ATP-dependent protease La","ATP-dependent serine proteinase"],"ontology_prefix":"EC","short_form":"EC_3.4.21.53","description":["Hydrolysis of proteins in presence of ATP"],"label":"endopeptidase La","obo_id":"EC:3.4.21.53","type":"individual"},{"iri":"https://www.enzyme-database.org/query.php?ec\u003d3.4.23.21","ontology_name":"ec","related_synonyms":["Rhizopus aspartic proteinase"],"ontology_prefix":"EC","short_form":"EC_3.4.23.21","description":["Hydrolysis of proteins with broad specificity similar to that of pepsinA, preferring hydrophobic residues at P1 and P1\u0027. Clots milk andactivates trypsinogen. Does not cleave 4-Gln-|-His-5, but does cleave10-His-|-Leu-11 and 12-Val-|-Glu-13 in B chain of insulin"],"label":"rhizopuspepsin","obo_id":"EC:3.4.23.21","type":"individual"},{"iri":"https://www.enzyme-database.org/query.php?ec\u003d3.4.23.22","ontology_name":"ec","related_synonyms":["Endothia aspartic proteinase"],"ontology_prefix":"EC","short_form":"EC_3.4.23.22","description":["Hydrolysis of proteins with specificity similar to that of pepsin A,prefers hydrophobic residues at P1 and P1\u0027, but does not cleave14-Ala-|-Leu-15 in the B chain of insulin or Z-Glu-Tyr. Clots milk"],"label":"endothiapepsin","obo_id":"EC:3.4.23.22","type":"individual"},{"iri":"https://www.enzyme-database.org/query.php?ec\u003d3.4